OL,3,GNEWSAShipping containers considered for
OL,4,Arough sleepers
OL,5,
OL,6,FRough sleepers in York could be housed
OL,7,Fin converted shipping containers and
OL,8,Fgarages as the council looks at new
OL,9,Fways to tackle homelessness.
OL,11,FA report to City of York Council said
OL,12,Fofficials might need to move beyond
OL,13,Ftraditional accommodation options as
OL,14,Fdemand for housing continued to grow.
OL,16,FThe authority is considering a range of
OL,17,Fmeasures, including modular housing
OL,18,Fschemes that could see homes created
OL,19,Fquickly.
